  "scope": [
    "Same-binary serial private full-row selector and warmed conditional selector in the actual synchronous SQLite loader. All eight pool slots warmed/observed; full-row selector shares borrowed decoder and has no token probes.",
    "This is a local combined dirty-checkout control. Its exact six owned source hashes and copied executable are retained; clean committed CI acceptance is separate.",
    "Disabled diagnostic query/token/pager/hit zero fields mean unavailable, not measured zero. Profiling-enabled positive full-row/load/pager controls establish observed query avoidance.",
    "Rust allocation calls and requested bytes are scoped to the current thread inside the synchronous loader. SQLite C allocations, async scheduling, end-to-end RPC, device operations and total process allocation churn are excluded.",
