    "CPU fields are whole-process deltas and can include other process work. Samples are short ordered control windows, not a production-capacity benchmark or backend ranking.",
    "Catalog shape represents definitions, not 10000 simultaneously connected or continuously active clients. Direct NAPI legacy storage does not traverse this catalog.",
    "Eight prior snapshots can be retained by certificates until their handles are revisited. Supported SQLite-managed writes and own CAS invalidate trust; unsupported raw file/WAL tampering is outside data_version freshness."
